# Processes the runaway watcher (~/.local/bin/runaway-watch) never flags as
# busy. One glob per line, matched against the process name as `ps -o ucomm`
# prints it (at most 16 characters). Stopped groups and GPU load are always
# reported. Expected long, heavy work belongs here, a helper that spins does not.

# Virtual machines (UTM, Apple Virtualization)
QEMULauncher
qemu-*
com.apple.Virtua*

# Indexing, media analysis and backups, which macOS runs in long bursts
mds
mds_stores
mdworker*
mdbulkimport
corespotlightd
mediaanalysisd
photoanalysisd
backupd*

# Compilers and build systems
clang
swift-frontend
swift-build
rustc
cc1*
ld
XCBBuildService

# Encoders and downloaders that run for hours by design
ffmpeg
HandBrakeCLI
aed*
